The lab repository should also retain its original instructions.md and rubric.md files.

Independent-review boundary

This audit uses the Intellectus system description and technical architecture supplied through the project repository and pull request. The builders' GDPR self-audit conclusions, lawful-basis selection, DPIA conclusion, and gap list were not reviewed before this assessment. The technical material therefore served as the data-processing brief and evidence packet.

Bottom line

Do not proceed with production processing of real personal data yet. The local demo may continue with synthetic or non-personal sample data. Before production, the controller must document a lawful basis and legitimate-interests assessment where applicable, identify all processors and transfers, execute required data-processing agreements, implement the authenticated production gateway and retention controls, provide GDPR transparency, operationalise data-subject rights, and complete a documented DPIA screening.

Required human step before submission

Meet with Gretel and Paola and complete the clearly marked Pending teammate input fields in the debrief file. Record their actual lawful-basis and DPIA conclusions, compare both gap lists, and write the joint closing note together. No teammate response has been invented in this pack.

